    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": " \nEdward Carey Property is delighted to present this great 4 bed semi-detached in a great location in the estate - close to the end of a small cul-de-sac & overlooking a large green area. Whilst the property would benefit from some redecoration, the potential is obvious for the discerning buyer. These properties have a great internal arrangement, with a good front living room overlooking the green area, a large kitchen/dining room having a separate utility room, and with patio doors to the rear garden they are ideal for family living. \n\nOutside, is excellent. There's off-street parking for 2 cars in the cobble lock drive, & the property overlooks the large green area, ideal for keeping an eye on the family! \n\nGlen Abhainn is a great family orientated estate, close to the village centre & with a superb creche facility close to its entrance. Enfield is a fantastic location with excellent bus & rail transport to the city, a wide range of shopping & entertainment venues, great restaurants, local primary school & several sports clubs all within easy reach. Viewing is a must. \n\nA Technical Statement showing no damage to the building that can be attributed to pyritic heave has been obtained by the vendors and is available on request. \n\nTo bid on this property, please go to my website www.edcarey.ie, find the listing & hit the Offr button to bring you to the registration field. I'll then approve your registration and you can bid at your convenience. "
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (1.81m x 5.72m) with tiled flooring & having carpet stairs, useful under-stairs storage<br>Guest WC (1.51m x 1.64m) with wc & whb<br>Living Room (3.53m x 5.72m) with laminate/semi solid wood flooring, ceiling coving, open fireplace, TV point, curtains/blinds included<br>Kitchen (2.56m x 3.16m) a superb family room with tiled flooring, patio doors to the patio area & rear garden, great kitchen area with excellent range of fitted kitchen cabinets & oven & hob included. <br>Family Room (5.45m x 4.21m) <br>Utility Room (1.51m x 1.43m) with tiled flooring & side entrance door<br>Bedroom 1 (3.17m x 4.27m) front master bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, curtains/blinds included<br>En-suite (1.61m x 1.88m) with shower, wc & whb<br>Bedroom 2 (2.74m x 3.66m) rear double bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, curtains/blinds included<br>Bedroom 3 (2.61m x 2.69m) rear bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, curtains/blinds included<br>Bedroom 4 (2.19m x 3.19m) front bedroom with laminate wood flooring, built-in wardrobes, curtains/blinds included<br>Family Bathroom (1.61m x 2.13m) family bathroom, with bath, wc & whb\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb 4 bed semi-detached, approx. 119 sq.m / 1,280 sq.ft\nGreat location in estate overlooking large green area\nSeparate useful utility room\nFront driveway with off street parking for 2 cars\nNew gas boiler installed\nVery popular family orientated estate, close to shops, schools, train, bus, etc. \nProperty built 2005, GFCH, BER B, potential A\nTechnical Statement showing no pyrite heave available. \n\n\n"
